  "notes": [
    "Lists are in priority order. Every hostname answered curl -s -o /dev/null -m 10 -w '%{http_code}' https://<host> on 2026-11-13; a 403 or a redirect counts as answering.",
    "A leading www. means the bare host did not answer HTTPS from the check machine. jurisdiction.ts already strips it.",
    "wildcards are official namespace patterns for Exa includeDomains, not checked hostnames. Countries without a government suffix (FI, SE, EE) have none.",
    "Exa includeDomains, tested live: a bare host also returns its subdomains (europa.eu returned eur-lex.europa.eu and transport.ec.europa.eu), and www. entries work.",
    "Public information services, not authorities: infofinland.fi, citizensinformation.ie, citizensadvice.org.uk, nationalrail.co.uk, verbraucherzentrale.de, anil.org, juridischloket.nl. Good for plain-language rules; prefer the authority or the statute for amounts and deadlines.",
    "European Consumer Centres (ecc.fi, konsumenteuropa.se, consumer.ee, evz.de, europe-consommateurs.eu, eccnederland.nl, ecc-netitalia.it, eccireland.ie, eccnet.eu) handle cross-border purchases only.",
    "Dispute boards and ombudsmen, decisions are recommendations or sector-specific: kuluttajariita.fi, arn.se, degeschillencommissie.nl, kifid.nl, skgz.nl, universalschlichtungsstelle.de, schlichtung-reise-und-verkehr.de, railombudsman.org, financial-ombudsman.org.uk, housing-ombudsman.org.uk, fspo.ie, ccts-cprst.ca.",
    "Official bodies on commercial-looking domains: workinfinland.com, workinestonia.com, make-it-in-germany.com, welcometofrance.com, equalityhumanrights.com, coveredca.com, sfmta.com, icbc.com, careeronestop.org, garanteinfanzia.org, unedic.org.",
    "Renamed in 2025 and 2026, old hosts redirect: ara.fi to varke.fi, avi.fi and valvira.fi to lvv.fi, ely-keskus.fi to elinvoimakeskus.fi, te-palvelut.fi to tyomarkkinatori.fi, service-public.fr to service-public.gouv.fr, bmfsfj.de to bmbfsfj.bund.de, bmj.de to bmjv.de, dfa.ie to ireland.ie, benefits.gov to usa.gov.",
    "These Finnish hosts answer a plain server request with a 403 bot challenge, so read them through Exa Contents: dvv.fi, energiavirasto.fi, finlandabroad.fi, hsl.fi, intermin.fi, lvm.fi, lvv.fi, migri.fi, oikeusasiamies.fi, okm.fi, poliisi.fi, stm.fi, tasa-arvo.fi, tem.fi, terveyskyla.fi, thl.fi, tietosuoja.fi, tukes.fi, tulli.fi, tyosuojelu.fi, um.fi, valtioneuvosto.fi, vayla.fi, vm.fi, yhdenvertaisuusvaltuutettu.fi, ym.fi.",
    "US and CA lists mix federal hosts with California, New York, San Francisco, Ontario, Quebec, British Columbia and Alberta. For another state or province add its own portal.",
    "The eu block applies to member states only. Your Europe lives under europa.eu/youreurope."
  ]
